<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H5
/P 266 0 R
/T (Some puppies were born naturally when the female had been sedated and prepared for a c-section. The relaxation of the muscles means the puppy was easier to pull free \(these puppies were deceased\). Distressed puppies did not survive the operation or longer than two days after birth, some seemed weak, and some dams were not attentive to their young. Of the owners with a veterinary agreement for an elective section on their due date, 100% of these puppies were born alive.)
/E (Some puppies were born naturally when the female had been sedated and prepared for a c-section. The relaxation of the muscles means the puppy was easier to pull free \(these puppies were deceased\). Distressed puppies did not survive the operation or longer than two days after birth, some seemed weak, and some dams were not attentive to their young. Of the owners with a veterinary agreement for an elective section on their due date, 100% of these puppies were born alive.)
/Pg 21 0 R
/K [18]
>>
